e point: the benefit is API uniformity and reduced parameter threading, not correctness of the volume computation itself."}],"summary":"Amendment fr-5-4a64f0c3 accepted. Both sides correctly verified the code: algae_growth.rs uses direct WaterState calls while 4 other systems use ConcentrationView, and nitrogen_cycle.rs is also inconsistent. The dissenting reviewer's objection that this doesn't fix all inconsistencies (nitrogen_cycle.rs remains) is valid but does not justify rejecting partial progress. Fixing algae_growth.rs is a low-risk, mechanical improvement that moves the codebase toward uniform read-access patterns."},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"6ed6113d-725e-452f-94ee-5a4f837c6a97"}
